# The models image's build context (deploy/models/Dockerfile): BuildKit reads this file in place
# of the root .dockerignore when the build names that Dockerfile. Everything is left out except
# the files and directories the build copies; the SLAB archive arrives by the `slabzip` named
# context and SCICHEM's source by the `scichemsrc` one (HB-167).
*
!src/hazbrief/brief/slab_driver.py
!docs/evidence/hb102/compare_outputs.py
!deploy/models/check_cases.py
!deploy/models/scichem/patches/
!deploy/models/scichem/build_engine.sh
!deploy/models/scichem/NOTICE
!src/hazbrief/brief/scichem_driver.py
!deploy/models/scichem/check/check_engine.py
!deploy/models/scichem/check/intel_reference_csxday_base.smp.gz
!deploy/models/scichem/check/case/
